+/* CNT_CLK of this systimer (Hz). TRM v1.8 ch.11 §11.2: "Use CNT_CLK for
+ * counting, with an average frequency of 16 MHz in two counting cycles. Use
+ * 40 MHz XTAL_CLK as the clock source of CNT_CLK", i.e. CNT_CLK = 2/5 x
